  "adaptations": [
    "Public native DSH benchmark replaces obsolete MCP transport and legacy adapter comparisons.",
    "Core benchmark imports target the bundled TypeScript core.",
    "Fixture data and deterministic stability thresholds are retained.",
    "Extracted into a standalone project; machine-specific source locations are omitted from the source candidate.",
    "One workstation-specific fixture image path was replaced with a neutral /workspace path for repository extraction. The new public baseline has a new dataset digest but unchanged metric thresholds; original baseline hashes and dataset identities are preserved as provenance.",
    "Archived obsolete intermediate baseline files outside the maintained project; their source names and hashes remain historical provenance, not runtime file references.",
    "Added a separate case-level deterministic quality floor captured from the saved pre-expansion source snapshot; preserved the original corpus, aggregate baseline and thresholds.",
    "Retained the original 500 metamorphic transformations and added full-corpus catalog-reorder checks with isolated temporary caches and independent outcome guards.",
    "Added strict retrieval and Native/PTC state-transition/provider contract suites, suite-specific report validation, and benchmark-oracle mutation tests.",
    "Separated construction, first-query and warm scale measurements while preserving the original executable 2000 ms first-query gate."
